{"seq":2,"slug":"visualization-interpretation","title":"可视化与解读","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/dimensionality-reduction/practice/visualization-interpretation","wordCount":1486,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"可视化与解读\">可视化与解读</h1><p>一张二维散点图能瞬间说服整个会议室——它也能瞬间误导整个会议室。降维可视化是数据科学里说服力与欺骗性都最高的图表之一：簇看起来泾渭分明，距离看起来意味深长，空隙看起来别有含义，但其中很多视觉特征是算法的产物，而非数据的事实。本篇教你负责任地读图——哪些特征可信、哪些不可信，以及如何用载荷和定量指标交叉验证你从图里读出的每一个结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>读降维图的第一原则是：先问这张图是线性方法还是非线性方法做的，因为两者能信的东西完全不同。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[一张降维散点图] --&gt; B{什么方法做的?}&#10;  B --&gt; C[PCA/SVD 等线性]&#10;  B --&gt; D[t-SNE/UMAP 等非线性]&#10;  C --&gt; E[轴有含义&lt;br/&gt;距离方差可信]&#10;  C --&gt; F[可用载荷解释轴]&#10;  D --&gt; G[轴无含义&lt;br/&gt;簇间距/簇大小不可信]&#10;  D --&gt; H[只信:有没有局部簇]&#10;  E --&gt; I[用定量指标复核]&#10;  G --&gt; I&#10;  H --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n  A[一张降维散点图] --&gt; B{什么方法做的?}\n  B --&gt; C[PCA/SVD 等线性]\n  B --&gt; D[t-SNE/UMAP 等非线性]\n  C --&gt; E[轴有含义&lt;br/&gt;距离方差可信]\n  C --&gt; F[可用载荷解释轴]\n  D --&gt; G[轴无含义&lt;br/&gt;簇间距/簇大小不可信]\n  D --&gt; H[只信:有没有局部簇]\n  E --&gt; I[用定量指标复核]\n  G --&gt; I\n  H --&gt; I</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>视觉特征</th>\n<th>线性（PCA）</th>\n<th>非线性（t-SNE/UMAP）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>坐标轴含义</td>\n<td>有（主成分）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>点间距离</td>\n<td>近似可信</td>\n<td>不可信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>簇的存在</td>\n<td>可信</td>\n<td>较可信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>簇的大小</td>\n<td>可信</td>\n<td>不可信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>簇之间的距离</td>\n<td>可信</td>\n<td>不可信</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"非线性图的四条解读铁律\">非线性图的四条解读铁律</h2><p><a href=\"../manifold-learning/tsne\">t-SNE</a> 和 <a href=\"../manifold-learning/umap\">UMAP</a> 的图最常被误读，下面四条是反复被强调却反复被违反的纪律。</p>\n<p>第一，<strong>簇的大小没有意义</strong>。t-SNE 会均衡化各簇密度，UMAP 受 min_dist 影响，所以一个簇画得大不代表它样本多或更分散。第二，<strong>簇之间的距离没有意义</strong>。两个簇画得远不代表它们在原空间更不像——全局距离根本不被这些方法保留。第三，<strong>单张图不可尽信</strong>。换一个困惑度/n_neighbors 或一个随机种子，布局可能大变；应当多取几组参数各跑一遍，只相信那些在多张图里都稳定出现的结构。第四，<strong>空隙和形状可能是伪结构</strong>。簇内的细丝、环状、空洞常是优化的副产物，不要据此编故事。</p>\n<p>记住一句话总结：非线性图里，你<strong>只能</strong>安全地读出&quot;有没有相对独立的局部簇&quot;，其余一概存疑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"线性图-轴本身就是信息\">线性图：轴本身就是信息</h2><p><a href=\"../linear-methods/pca\">PCA</a> 的图待遇好得多，因为它的坐标轴是有含义的——每个轴是原始特征的线性组合，距离和方差也近似可信。这意味着你可以反过来问：&quot;第一主成分到底代表什么？&quot;答案藏在<strong>载荷</strong>里。</p>\n<p>载荷是主成分在各原始特征上的系数。某个特征在 PC1 上载荷大，就说明 PC1 主要由它驱动。把每个主成分载荷最大的几个原始特征列出来，常能给抽象的主成分赋予业务解释——比如在消费数据里，PC1 可能由各类支出共同正向驱动，于是可解读为&quot;总体消费水平&quot;。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>PC</mtext><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext> 大</mtext><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mtext> 主导</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PC}_1 = w_{11}x_1 + w_{12}x_2 + \\cdots + w_{1d}x_d, \\qquad |w_{1j}| \\text{ 大} \\Rightarrow x_j \\text{ 主导}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PC</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">11</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">大</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">主导</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这是线性方法相对非线性方法不可替代的优势：图不仅能看，轴还能解释。双标图（biplot）把样本点和特征载荷向量画在同一张图上，是同时看分布和解释的利器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用定量指标给眼睛上保险\">用定量指标给眼睛上保险</h2><p>光靠肉眼判断&quot;嵌入好不好&quot;太主观。几个定量指标能把直觉变成可比较的数字，给读图上一道保险。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>衡量什么</th>\n<th>高分含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可信度（trustworthiness）</td>\n<td>低维近邻在高维是否也近邻</td>\n<td>假近邻少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连续性（continuity）</td>\n<td>高维近邻在低维是否仍近邻</td>\n<td>真近邻没被拆散</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>邻域保持率</td>\n<td>k 近邻在高低维的重合度</td>\n<td>局部结构保留好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重建误差</td>\n<td>还原原数据的偏差</td>\n<td>全局信息保留好（线性/自编码器）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>可信度是其中最常用的一个：它惩罚那些&quot;在低维图里看着是邻居、在高维其实离很远&quot;的假近邻——而假近邻恰是误导性结论的最大来源。scikit-learn 直接提供 <code>trustworthiness</code>。给嵌入算个可信度分数，比反复盯着图猜要靠谱得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把可视化做得更负责任\">把可视化做得更负责任</h2><p>几条能立刻提升可信度的实践习惯。给图叠加已知标签或元数据上色——如果同色点确实聚在一起，说明嵌入抓到了真实结构，这是最廉价的健全性检查。对随机种子和关键超参做敏感性分析，把多张图并排放，让读者看到哪些结构稳定。在非线性嵌入旁边附一张 PCA 图作对照，因为 PCA 的全局几何可信，能帮你判断非线性图里那些&quot;远近&quot;是否被严重扭曲。以及，永远在图注里写清方法、超参和随机种子，让结论可复现。</p>\n<p>这些习惯背后是同一个态度：可视化是探索的起点而非结论的终点。任何从图里读出的模式，都该回到原数据或下游指标里验证一遍——而验证能不能站得住，又取决于整条流水线有没有数据泄漏，这把我们引向 <a href=\"pipelines-pitfalls\">流水线与常见陷阱</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>读图第一问：线性还是非线性方法——两者能信的特征完全不同。</li>\n<li>非线性图四铁律：簇大小无意义、簇间距无意义、单图不可尽信、空隙形状可能是伪结构；<strong>只能信&quot;有没有局部簇&quot;</strong>。</li>\n<li>线性图的轴有含义，可用<strong>载荷</strong>反解主成分的业务意义，双标图同时看分布与解释。</li>\n<li>用<strong>可信度/连续性/邻域保持率</strong>等定量指标给肉眼判断上保险。</li>\n<li>负责任的习惯：按标签上色做健全性检查、对超参做敏感性分析、附 PCA 对照图、图注写清参数与种子。</li>\n<li>可视化是探索起点，结论须回到数据或下游指标验证。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可视化与解读","id":"可视化与解读"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"非线性图的四条解读铁律","id":"非线性图的四条解读铁律"},{"level":2,"text":"线性图：轴本身就是信息","id":"线性图-轴本身就是信息"},{"level":2,"text":"用定量指标给眼睛上保险","id":"用定量指标给眼睛上保险"},{"level":2,"text":"把可视化做得更负责任","id":"把可视化做得更负责任"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"选择目标维数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/dimensionality-reduction/practice/choosing-components"},"next":{"title":"流水线与常见陷阱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/dimensionality-reduction/practice/pipelines-pitfalls"}}